<h2 style="text-align:center"><img alt="City of Milwaukee" loading="lazy" src="/ImageLibrary/Groups/cityHomepage/CityLogo_White.png"></h2>

<p><span style="font-size:14px">Established in 1846, the City of Milwaukee is home to nearly 600,000 residents and is a city built on water with over 10 miles of lakefront shoreline. With three rivers and a Great Lake, water plays a key role in the city’s history, identity, and economy.</span></p>

<p><a href="/cityclerk/libraryAnswerstoFAQ" linktype="2" target="_self">About Us</a> |&nbsp;<a href="https://mkeregion.com//" linktype="3" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Milwaukee Region</a>&nbsp;| <a href="/ucc" linktype="2" target="_self">Contact Us</a></p>

